capability jsonDocumentWriteCapability json.document.tree write
purpose operation jsonDocumentWriteCapability "Authority to create and serialize bounded audit JSON documents."
capability sqliteDatabaseReader database read
purpose operation sqliteDatabaseReader "Authority to execute read-only SQLite audit statements."
capability jwtTokenSigner jwt.hs256 signVerify
purpose operation jwtTokenSigner "Authority to verify HS256 bearer tokens through the server auth context."

